Z||000008||DJRice||05-02-2001||10:25 PM||||Chances are your car will never run right since that fan is inoperative.  I recommend you sell that car to me at a ridiculously low price to save yourself the trouble of fixing that fan.<P>&lt;kidding&gt;<P>Just turn on your AC with the engine off and the radiator fan as well as the trunk blower should start up.  If the trunk blower doesnt work, you should first check the relay which is mounted right near the blower itself.  <P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<p>[This message has been edited by DJRice (edited 05-02-2001).]||||reg||1
